How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video.

integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Continuous over-the-shoulder shot in the dark pump room. The camera is locked off on a tripod and does not move, zoom or drift at all. Start exactly at Picture 1. The young woman stands still in front of the computer monitor on the control desk, reading it; she leans in very slightly, her breathing visible in her shoulders, and her gloved hand tightens around the small black device she has just picked up. The monitor stays exactly where it is, flat, level and fully visible, its light-gray screen unchanged and steady the whole time; nothing on the screen moves. No text appears. Keep the dark blue-green industrial color grade.

overall_soundscape: The low hum of machinery, a computer fan, her slow breathing through the respirator, a faint electronic notification ping at the start.

